; A remainder smaller than one unit of a cost commodity whose display
; precision is still 0 is reported at the precision the balance check
; used, not rounded to 0, whether finalize() or, after an automated
; transaction has added postings, verify() finds it.  EUR appears only
; in costs, so no amount teaches it a precision or a style.

= /^Expenses/
    [E]     1 FOO @ 1.03 EUR
    [F]    -1 FOO @ 1.01 EUR

2024/01/01 Real
    C     1 FOO @ 1.03 EUR
    D    -1 FOO @ 1.01 EUR

2024/01/02 Bracketed
    [C]   1 FOO @ 1.03 EUR
    [D]  -1 FOO @ 1.01 EUR

2024/01/03 Automated
    Expenses:Food    $1
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 3
